  LeanVM.Guest.Memory.GuestCntVK

  The guest's static certificates counting `keccak` instructions (`B2C.ωArm B2C.xmssArmC .keccak`),
  checked (`kvk_checked`), and the weight bounds they give (`kvk_weightLe`, `kvk_weight_le_of_stat`,
  `kvk_weight_le_of_loop`). Generated by `scripts/count/gen.py`; do not edit.
-/

